@startuml
title Week 1 Architecture: MinIO Distributed Lab
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Client / Data Ingestion" as Client #D9EAF7

frame "Docker Virtual Network" as DockerNet {
  rectangle "Nginx Load Balancer" as Nginx #FFF2CC
  rectangle "MinIO node 1" as M1 #D5E8D4
  rectangle "MinIO node 2" as M2 #D5E8D4
  rectangle "MinIO node 3" as M3 #D5E8D4
  rectangle "MinIO node 4" as M4 #D5E8D4
}

rectangle "Prometheus / Grafana" as Metrics #F8CECC

Client --> Nginx : S3 API requests
Nginx --> M1 : route object traffic
Nginx --> M2 : route object traffic
Nginx --> M3 : route object traffic
Nginx --> M4 : route object traffic

M1 ..> Metrics : cluster metrics
M2 ..> Metrics : cluster metrics
M3 ..> Metrics : cluster metrics
M4 ..> Metrics : cluster metrics

note bottom of DockerNet
4 MinIO nodes share the same Docker virtual network
to model distributed storage behavior for the lab.
end note

@enduml
